    {
      "id": "claim_9f2064b61ccb4c1fa58a85a0e5f7bc94",
      "statement": "The four model operators live in evidence-model-core (re-exported from its public index) and each returns an OperatorPatch — a batch of plain ModelPatchCommand descriptions plus createdIds in the order the commands create objects — which the caller submits through the ordinary apply_model_patch channel; an operator is therefore a named, reusable assembly of commands, not a second write path.",
