      "statement": "CreateFulfillmentPairCommand writes the whole fulfillment unit in one command: request and confirmation entities with distinct ids, the 1..1 confirmation → request reference, an optional request → root Contract reference, and a completion rule whose default expression requires a confirmation formed between request.started_at and request.expired_at.",
